# type(scope): subject, imperative, lowercase, <=50 chars, no period
# e.g. feat(auth): add password reset
#
# Body: what and why, wrap at 72 chars. Blank line above/below.
# Explain the problem, the solution, and alternatives considered.
#
# Footer: Fixes #123, Refs #456, BREAKING CHANGE: description
#
# Guidance (stripped from commit - do not uncomment):
#  type: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
#  scope: optional, e.g. api, ui, auth, docs, deps
#  subject: imperative, lowercase, no trailing period
#  body: explain what and why, not how; wrap at 72 chars
#  footer: e.g. Fixes #123, Refs #456, BREAKING CHANGE: describe breakage
#  Keep commits focused; separate unrelated changes.
#  Never commit secrets or credentials; check staged files before committing.
